<title>USA: Performance Nutrition files to sell assets.</title>
<headline>Performance Nutrition files to sell assets.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Performance Nutrition Inc said on Thursday it filed a motion in bankruptcy court to sell its operating assets to Naturade Inc of California.</p>
<p>Performance filed on January 21 for reorganization under Chapter 11 of the Bankruptcy Code, seeking relief from ongoing litigation.</p>
</text>
